('0017ae68-1869-5ea1-9be3-8c0ff7329bef'::uuid, 'Anatomy Histology Embryology (Paper 1)', 'Special Histology - Special Senses', 'Which option best defines the cornea?', '["The transparent","avascular anterior part of the fibrous layer that refracts light (2/3 of the eye''s refractive power)","The white part of the eye","The vascular part of the eye","The colored part of the eye"]'::jsonb, 'The transparent', 'The cornea is the transparent, avascular, anterior segment of the fibrous tunic and contributes about two-thirds of the eye''s refractive power. The white part of the eye is the sclera, and the cornea is neither vascular nor the colored (iridial) component.'),
('9330c8e8-58b1-514a-90ce-f078abdf3638'::uuid, 'Anatomy Histology Embryology (Paper 1)', 'Special Histology - Special Senses', 'What is the cornea? Which option is most accurate?', '["The transparent","avascular anterior part of the fibrous layer that refracts light (2/3 of the eye''s refractive power)","The white part of the eye","The vascular part of the eye","The colored part of the eye"]'::jsonb, 'The transparent', 'The cornea is the transparent, avascular, anterior segment of the fibrous tunic and contributes about two-thirds of the eye''s refractive power. The white part of the eye is the sclera, and the cornea is neither vascular nor the colored (iridial) component.'),
