('6d15d7b2-7e13-5810-878a-0c6ac65eaea5'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 1)', 'Autonomic Nervous System - ANS Pharmacology', 'The recommended adult dose of intramuscular epinephrine for anaphylaxis is:', '["0.3-0.5 mg of 1:1000","1-2 mg of 1:10,000","5-10 mg of 1:1000","0.01-0.02 mg/kg IV","10 mg IV"]'::jsonb, '0.3-0.5 mg of 1:1000', 'Adult dose: 0.3-0.5 mg Epi 1:1000 IM in anterolateral thigh.'),
