('625457eb-f5f8-5754-9a88-6c13543aacfd'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 1)', 'Autonomic Nervous System - ANS Pharmacology', 'Silodosin, used for benign prostatic hyperplasia, is selective for which alpha-adrenergic receptor subtype?', '["Alpha-1A","Alpha-1B","Alpha-2","Beta-1","Beta-2"]'::jsonb, 'Alpha-1A', 'Silodosin is selective for alpha-1A receptors in the prostate.'),
