('cd710a41-f960-506e-a346-c2a43632a7ae'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 1)', 'Autonomic Nervous System - ANS Pharmacology', 'Esmolol, which has a very short half-life, is particularly useful in the management of:', '["Chronic hypertension resulting in decreased functional activity","Intraoperative and postoperative tachycardia/hypertension","Heart failure maintenance mediated by specific receptor activation","Angina pectoris without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Migraine prophylaxis leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Intraoperative and postoperative tachycardia/hypertension', 'Esmolol has very short half-life (9 min) for acute perioperative use.'),
