('d92402f1-b271-5266-9f1d-908e4357729b'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 2)', 'Hematologic Coagulation - Hematologic Drugs', 'East Asians need lower warfarin because:', '["Higher VKORC1 -1639A frequency (increased sensitivity)","Lower VKORC1 accompanied by associated clinical symptoms","CYP2C9*3 mediated by specific receptor activation","All above without affecting the primary tissue pathway","None leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Higher VKORC1 -1639A frequency (increased sensitivity)', 'Higher -1639A frequency = greater warfarin sensitivity.'),
