('6136672c-c45c-5568-919b-f0e98fa35e5e'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 2)', 'Hematologic Coagulation - Hematologic Drugs', 'Fibrin specificity decreasing order:', '["Tenecteplase>alteplase>streptokinase","Streptokinase>alteplase>tenecteplase","Alteplase>tenecteplase>streptokinase","All equal","Streptokinase most specific"]'::jsonb, 'Tenecteplase>alteplase>streptokinase', 'Tenecteplase 30x>alteplase>streptokinase (non-specific).'),
