('c2042856-cc1a-5ba3-963c-6a9d04650069'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 2)', 'Hematologic Coagulation - Hematologic Drugs', 'Fondaparinux doesn''t cause HIT because:', '["Too small to bind PF4 resulting in decreased functional activity","Synthetic pentasaccharide not binding PF4","SC route mediated by specific receptor activation","No anticoagulant effect without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Antiplatelet leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Synthetic pentasaccharide not binding PF4', 'Does not bind PF4, cannot form neoantigen triggering HIT antibodies.'),
