('49e39d56-942f-5b8b-9126-78ca660c92e7'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 2)', 'Hematologic Coagulation - Hematologic Drugs', 'TXA lysine analogue competes with:', '["Glutamic acid resulting in decreased functional activity","Lysine residues on plasminogen binding to fibrin","Arginine mediated by specific receptor activation","Methionine without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Tryptophan leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Lysine residues on plasminogen binding to fibrin', 'Competes with plasminogen lysine-binding sites for fibrin interaction.'),
