('968b4fef-89fd-5807-a81c-441f0d9ab60e'::uuid, 'Pharmacology (Paper 2)', 'Hematologic Coagulation - Hematologic Drugs', 'Warfarin in HIT started after:', '["Immediately resulting in decreased functional activity","Platelet recovery >=150 x 10^9/L on alternative anticoagulation","24h heparin cessation mediated by specific receptor activation","1 week cessation without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Never leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Platelet recovery >=150 x 10^9/L on alternative anticoagulation', 'Only after platelet recovery >=150 on therapeutic alternative anticoagulation.'),
