('3ad2712b-7b80-5788-806f-8a06fe9a151b'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 1', 'HDV coinfection with HBV:', '["Always chronic","Usually self-limited","Fatal","Mild","Asymptomatic"]'::jsonb, 'Usually self-limited', 'HDV coinfection with HBV usually results in self-limited disease.'),
