('6dbd6bd7-b666-5efa-9a9a-523a1f60d8bc'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 1', 'HIV-associated lipodystrophy:', '["Only with protease inhibitors resulting in decreased functional activity","Only with NRTIs accompanied by associated clinical symptoms","Long-term antiretroviral therapy (especially older PIs/NRTIs)","Only with INSTIs without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Only with NNRTIs leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Long-term antiretroviral therapy (especially older PIs/NRTIs)', 'Lipodystrophy is a metabolic complication of long-term ART.'),
