('aafe39a1-e242-5cff-9da0-654b8deace04'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 1', 'Cidofovir given with:', '["Probenecid + IV hydration","Furosemide accompanied by associated clinical symptoms","Mesna mediated by specific receptor activation","Allopurinol without affecting the primary tissue pathway","NaHCO3 leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Probenecid + IV hydration', 'Probenecid + IV hydration reduces cidofovir nephrotoxicity.'),
