('d022e5db-b64f-5991-90f6-cd9555cd0915'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 1', 'Letermovir is a:', '["Protease inhibitor","Polymerase inhibitor","CMV terminase inhibitor","Entry inhibitor","Integrase inhibitor"]'::jsonb, 'CMV terminase inhibitor', 'Letermovir inhibits CMV UL56 terminase complex.'),
