('2586d2d6-4450-5078-884c-be97a76f6897'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 1', 'HBV cccDNA:', '["Viral mRNA resulting in decreased functional activity","Covalently closed circular DNA in nucleus","Viral RNA mediated by specific receptor activation","Viral protein without affecting the primary tissue pathway","Integrated DNA leading to subsequent cellular adaptation"]'::jsonb, 'Covalently closed circular DNA in nucleus', 'cccDNA is the stable viral DNA reservoir in hepatocyte nuclei.'),
