('77b89f10-84ec-599b-a3ca-9c0bf4b0e1f8'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 2', 'From a pathophysiological standpoint regarding Virology Pt2: CMV retinitis occurs at CD4:', '["<200 cells/mm3","<100 cells/mm3","<50 cells/mm3","<350 cells/mm3","<500 cells/mm3"]'::jsonb, '<50 cells/mm3', 'CMV retinitis occurs with severe immunosuppression (CD4 <50).'),
