('0935dc73-b422-52ad-a075-617bdb9765e8'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 2', 'COVID-19 Paxlovid timing:', '["Any time","Within 5 days of symptom onset","Within 24 hours","Within 1 week","After hospitalization"]'::jsonb, 'Within 5 days of symptom onset', 'Paxlovid most effective when started within 5 days of symptom onset.'),
