('b28167d1-b96d-5581-864c-44cd03af2ade'::uuid, 'General Pathology Microbiology Immunology (Paper 2)', 'Virology - Virology Part 2', 'Concerning diagnostic evaluations in Virology Pt2: HIV and pregnancy:', '["ART reduces vertical transmission to <1%","Cesarean always required","Breastfeeding contraindicated","No treatment during pregnancy","Vertical transmission 100%"]'::jsonb, 'ART reduces vertical transmission to <1%', 'With proper ART, vertical transmission rate is <1%.'),
